   - Website: {{url}}
   - Key Strengths:
     - {{strength-1}}
     - {{strength-2}}
     - {{strength-3}}

2. **{{competitor-name}}**
   - Website: {{url}}
   - Key Strengths:
     - {{strength-1}}
     - {{strength-2}}
     - {{strength-3}}

3. **{{competitor-name}}**
   - Website: {{url}}
